content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "description": "Person or company using telecommunication services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Mobile Connection",
        "Financial Records"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Financial Records",
      "description": "Contains billing and payment history for a customer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Mobile Connection",
      "description": "Represents the active mobile service of a customer."
    },
    {
      "name": "Connection Request",
      "description": "Request made by a customer to start a new mobile connection.",
      "attributes": [
        "Service Plan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Service Plan",
      "description": "Defines pricing, data, and call limits for a connection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Customer Service Agent",
      "description": "Handles customer requests, updates, and issue reports."
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Outage Report",
      "description": "Report created when a customer experiences network problems."
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Bill",
      "description": "Record of charges for services used by a customer.",
      "attributes": [
        "Service Plan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Technician",
      "description": "Installs, tests, and repairs network connections."
    },
    {
      "name": "Network Installation",
      "description": "Setup process that activates a customer’s mobile connection.",
      "attributes": [
        "Signal Test"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Signal Test",
      "description": "A test to determine whether the signal is strong enough."
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Ticket",
      "description": "Record of a service issue that needs technical repair."
    },
    {
      "name": "Maintenance Visit",
      "description": "On-site visit by a technician to repair or maintain a connection."
    },
    {
      "name": "Billing Officer",
      "description": "Prepares invoices and manages customer payments."
    },
    {
      "name": "Invoice",
      "description": "Document listing service charges and payment details."
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Network Setup": {
      "objects": [
        "Network Technician",
        "Connection Request",
        "Service Plan",
        "Network Installation",
        "Signal Test",
        "Mobile Connection"
      ]
    },
    "Customer Service": {
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Connection Request",
        "Service Plan",
        "Network Outage Report",
        "Customer Service Agent"
      ]
    },
    "Maintenance": {
      "objects": [
        "Network Technician",
        "Maintenance Ticket",
        "Maintenance Visit"
      ]
    },
    "Billing": {
      "objects": [
        "Billing Officer",
        "Invoice",
        "Network Bill",
        "Service Plan",
        "Financial Records"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Network Setup": {
      "derived from": "Network Setup Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Installer",
        "Setup Order",
        "Service Order",
        "Network Installation",
        "Signal Test",
        "Mobile Connection"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Network Technician -> Installer",
        "Connection Request -> Setup Order",
        "Service Plan -> Service Order"
      ]
    },
    "Customer Service": {
      "derived from": "Customer Service Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Customer",
        "Connection Request",
        "Service Plan",
        "Network Outage Report",
        "Customer Service Agent"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Maintenance": {
      "derived from": "Maintenance Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Network Technician",
        "Maintenance Ticket",
        "Maintenance Visit"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Billing": {
      "derived from": "Billing Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Billing Officer",
        "Invoice",
        "Network Bill",
        "Provided Services",
        "Financial Records"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Service Plan -> Provided Services"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
